{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#card-zh","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"会话重试（Session retry）是供 DSH 网页客户端使用的会话管理插件，在助手消息动作条加入“重新回答”按钮。宿主侧扫描会话事件，将轮次末尾的助手消息与该轮用户提问配对；点击后先登记可见面影子计划，再于下一请求的 agent/request 步骤中写入替换事件，令旧回答退出模型上下文，随后把提问排队提交给同一会话。它支持合并同轮多条文字提问，并提示未重发的非文字内容；适合需要在原会话中重生成回答的用户。无需额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:508","index.js:505","index.js:169","index.js:334"]}
{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#card-en","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session retry adds an “Answer again” action to DSH web chat. It pairs a turn’s assistant message with its prompt, hides the old answer from context, then queues that prompt in the same session. Non-text parts are omitted. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:508","index.js:505","index.js:169","index.js:334"]}
