{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#feature-1","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"会话重试（Session retry）的功能「动作条重新回答」：在助手消息动作条上提供按钮，将该轮提问重新排队提交到当前会话。先成功登记影子计划才会提交；会话正在运行或不可用时会显示原因。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:280","client.js:508"]}
{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#feature-2","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"会话重试（Session retry）的功能「轮次提问配对」：读取会话事件，将每轮最后一个有文本回答步骤的助手消息与其前面的人工提问关联，供对应动作条显示可用状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:169","index.js:373"]}
{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#feature-3","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"会话重试（Session retry）的功能「旧回答退出上下文」：重新回答前按提问位置计算可见面替换范围，并在下一请求打开步骤后写入空 system 替换节点，使旧回答及其后的内容不进入新的模型上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:267","index.js:334","index.js:525"]}
{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#caveat-1","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"会话重答只重发文字块；图片、附件等非文字内容不会随提问提交，界面会提示遗漏数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102","client.js:281"]}
{"unit_id":"linanbuan__dsh-session-retry#caveat-2","repo":"linanbuan/dsh-session-retry","commit":"d7f4c29fd781aba395db56b7754b029840eef05f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"重答仅适用于应用内仍打开且当前空闲的会话；运行中的会话会被拒绝，较早轮次重答也会让该轮之后的内容退出模型上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:427","index.js:443","index.js:267"]}
